    "created_at": "2022-12-02T13:11:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-12-02T13:11:40Z",
    "body": "I think you want percent-decoding. Otherwise you cannot link `id=†` for instance. I'd probably argue we don't want the literal matching. `#%25` should match `id=%` not `id=%25`.\r\n\r\nSo yeah, we'd want to abstract that somehow and have an optional boolean _enableLegacy_ or some such that you wouldn't set.\r\n\r\nIf that sounds reasonable to everyone I can look at making a PR.\r\n\r\ncc @rniwa @whatwg/css @smaug---- ",
