    "updated_at": "2022-12-06T00:26:53Z",
    "body": "It shouldn't have any implications, no.  My algo will need to walk the ancestor trees, but that won't affect how I call this algorithm. I still want to search within a given tree first, and ideally do so in a consistent way to the rest of the platform, which extracting this algo will help with.",
